      "title": "构造pending：在用户未执行命令时，HTTP与WebSocket均不得抵达origin。 / Arrange pending traffic: neither HTTP nor WebSocket may reach origin while no user command runs.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-002.png",
      "rawImage": "step-002.png"
    },
    {
